MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 12.10.2026: «Max tokens», 32K by default (a value kept at the old 8192 taken as the default); an empty answer or a failure of the model in the studio's dialog; an answer that came scrolled to the window's top; the status line at the output limit in the eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
